# oracle: pair edpd with fix edpd/source given by regions (the region form of examples/PACKAGES/dpd-meso/edpd/in.edpd-region, cut down to an 8 x 8 x 8 box with 2048 atoms; 50 + 50 steps, the length at which the chaotic divergence from native's rounding stays below 1e-10)
# Measured with native LAMMPS (black box): engine vs native max error 9.4e-14 (thermo) and 4.5e-10 (per-atom, scale max(1,|x|)) under vitest (Node 24); under Node 20 with a rolldown bundle 7.8e-14 (thermo) and 2.9e-9 (per-atom). The region sources and the per-pair draws follow native's order step by step; 50 + 50 steps for the same chaotic reason as w93meso_edpd.
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-10 abs=0
# oracle-files: temp.profile
units                   lj
dimension               3
boundary                p p p
neighbor                0.2 bin
neigh_modify        every 1 delay 0 check yes

atom_style              edpd
comm_modify vel yes

region     edpd     block -4 4 -4 4 -4 4 units box
create_box          1 edpd
create_atoms        1 random 2048 276438 NULL
mass                1 1.0
set                 atom * edpd/temp 1.0
set                 atom * edpd/cv 1.0E5

pair_style          edpd 1.58 9872598
pair_coeff          1 1 18.75 4.5 0.41 1.58 1.41E-5 2.0 1.58 &
                        power 10.54 -3.66 3.44 -4.10 &
                        kappa -0.44 -3.21 5.04  0.00

compute             mythermo all temp
thermo              50
thermo_style        custom step temp pe ke etotal press
thermo_modify       temp mythermo
thermo_modify       flush yes
thermo_modify       format float %.15g

velocity            all create 1.0 432982 loop local dist gaussian

region upper block -4.0  4.0   0.0 4.0 -4.0 4.0
region lower block -4.0  4.0  -4.0 0.0 -4.0 4.0

fix         mvv     all mvv/edpd 0.5
fix         upper   all edpd/source region upper  0.011
fix         lower   all edpd/source region lower -0.011

timestep            0.01
run                 50
reset_timestep      0

compute     temp    all edpd/temp/atom
compute     ccT     all chunk/atom bin/1d y 0.0 1.0
fix         stat    all ave/chunk 1 50 50 ccT c_temp density/number norm sample file temp.profile

run                 50
